---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="ABOUT">
  <div class="page-wrap">
    <div class="page-heading reveal">
      <div class="page-heading-en">About</div>
      <h1 class="page-heading-zh">关于</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="about-content reveal">
      <p>一个写代码的，偶尔按快门。记录技术、思想与旅途中的瞬间。</p>
      <p>这里没有广告，没有商业合作，只有真实的记录和独立的思考。</p>
      <div class="about-links">
        <a href="https://github.com/pessimist11" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
